OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to reopen rail tunnel and
OL,4,Atackle orange water
OL,5,
OL,6,FFunding has been announced to reopen a
OL,7,Frail tunnel and tackle orange water in
OL,8,Fa nearby harbour.
OL,10,FNetwork Rail said it had "firm
OL,11,Fproposals" and #60m government funding
OL,12,Fto open Bransty tunnel on the Cumbrian
OL,13,FCoast Line and treat discoloured water
OL,14,Fflowing from it into Whitehaven's
OL,15,FQueens Dock.
OL,17,FLocal MP Josh MacAlister said plans
OL,18,Fincluded a permanent water filter and
OL,19,Fwork to fill the old mine workings
OL,20,Funder the track.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
